    "preview": "Copy Page\nmatchMetadata Bundle\nFor calls to the\nMatch Endpoint\n, the\nmatchMetadata\nbundle returns information about the components that were used to obtain the match.\nSee the table below for information on the metadata elements returned.\nData Element\nType\nDescription\nExample or Valid Values\nmatchComponents\narray of strings\nComponents that contributed to the match\nname|streetAddress|zipCode|businessName|phoneNumber|emailAddress\ndistinctMatch\nboolean\nWhen distinctMatch equals true this flag indicates that a single highest score match was found. N"
  },
